## Tech stack
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Next.js 14 (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + Radix UI primitives
- Supabase (Postgres + Auth + Storage) — **local Supabase CLI stack** for dev
- Stripe (deposits + refunds + webhooks) via Payment Elements (test mode)
- Resend (email) + Twilio (SMS)
- Vercel (hosting + cron for reminders / hold-cleanup)

### Client strategy (fixes v1's single anon client)
- `lib/supabase/browser.ts` — anon client, browser, respects RLS (auth session).
- `lib/supabase/server.ts` — SSR client bound to cookies for the logged-in user.
- `lib/supabase/admin.ts` — **service-role** client, server-only, for privileged writes
  (client/appointment creation, payment bookkeeping, webhook status flips, refunds).
  Never imported into a client component.

